+### `refractometer/` — per-device WebGPU kernel sweeps
+
+`web/refract.js` generates the sweep kernels (vec4 copy and read-reduce, a 4M-float reduction as a tree or with `subgroupAdd`, `eg2-wgsl-engine`'s MatMulNBits q4 matmul generalized to C columns × S k-splits × R rows, the tail's 2-bit `SCAN` with workgroup size, LUT placement and vectors per thread, and a tiled f32/f16 matmul), verifies each config against a JS reference, and times it with timestamp-query or wall clock. `web/index.html` plots each sweep with the winner, the engine's or tail's current config and the cliffs, and saves a profile keyed `vendor/architecture/device`. `web/tuned.js` `getTuned(adapter, kernel, fallback, {defaultLimits})` returns the saved config. `run/check.mjs` compiles and verifies the full grid headless on Dawn/lavapipe. [`RESULTS.md`](refractometer/RESULTS.md)
+
